### 1. Remote image URL
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "model": "{{model}}",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "请用中文简短描述这张图片里有什么。"
        },
        {
          "type": "image_url",
          "image_url": {
            "url": "{{imageUrl}}"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "max_tokens": 300,
  "temperature": 0.2
}

### 2. Base64 data URL
